{
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_DEFAULT.0-0r.char": "Finally reached the top, huh...? Climbing the spire is just too exhausting. I really just want to go back and take a nap right now...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_DEFAULT.0-0r.next": "Complain",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_DEFAULT.0-1r.ancient": "You scaled this Spire through countless hardships, merely to seek a place for eternal rest? Utterly absurd.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_DEFAULT.0-attack": "BOTH",
  
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_DEFAULT.1-0r.ancient": "You have returned, unmotivated invader.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_DEFAULT.1-0r.next": "Sigh",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_DEFAULT.1-1r.char": "Sigh... If I don't take care of you, my leisurely afternoon tea time will be completely ruined. Just thinking about it is such a pain...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_DEFAULT.1-attack": "BOTH",
  
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_DEFAULT.2-0r.char": "If I defeat you here, will the Commander approve my paid leave? ...Probably?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_DEFAULT.2-0r.next": "Anticipate",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_DEFAULT.2-1r.ancient": "There is no Commander here. Only eternal order and labor.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_DEFAULT.2-attack": "BOTH",
  
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_MAID.0-0r.char": "I changed into this maid outfit specifically so I could slack off in the corner without being bothered... Why do I still have to deal with a big guy like you...?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_MAID.0-0r.next": "Sigh",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_MAID.0-1r.ancient": "A mere maid? The Spire is no place for you.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_MAID.0-attack": "BOTH",
  
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_MAID.1-0r.ancient": "What do you intend to do in that attire? Sweep me away like dust?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_MAID.1-0r.next": "Deny",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_MAID.1-1r.char": "Cleaning? No, no, no, I wouldn't do something so troublesome. I just want to find a quiet place to rest for a bit...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_MAID.1-attack": "BOTH",
  
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_MAID.2-0r.char": "*Yawn*... The Commander isn't here anyway, so no one will see even if I work hard... Let's just get this over with.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_MAID.2-0r.next": "Slack off",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_MAID.2-1r.ancient": "Facing your end with such an attitude... you will regret it.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_MAID.2-attack": "BOTH",
  
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDOMITABLESPIRE2-INDOMITABLE_RACE_QUEEN.0-0r.char": "",
